label diagnose_intro
- What happened?
	MC: Which part of it is "broken"?
	LK (sad): Sometimes it turns off on its own, and the fans have gotten really loud...
	LK (frown): I'm too scared to play any games on it.
	MC (neutral): Is that so...
	LK (sad): Can you fix it, mister?
- How did this happen?
	MC (neutral): (I should hear what's actually wrong first.)
	jump diagnose_intro
MC (neutral_closed): hmm...
- How did this happen?
	MC (neutral): When did it start being like this? Did you do anything in particular?
	LK (sad): uhm... I...
	LK (sad): ...
	MC (neutral): ..?
	LK (sad): ...I'm sorry... it started being like that when I wanted to play a game, but it was really slow...
	LK (frown): Then I looked up how to make it faster... and followed a tutorial...
	MC (neutral): What did the tutorial say?
	LK (sad): I don't remember...
	MC (shock): Huh?
	LK (sad): I went and changed some settings but I can't remember what I changed...
	LK (frown): I tried to fix it myself but I couldn't...
	MC (smile): Hey, it's okay. Please don't cry...
	MC (smile): I'll fix it for you, so cheer up!
